{"title":"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the set of integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/6/99645a266782624289fbc650b5d208e27bff9fc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1,2,3,\\dots,2009\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"137\" height=\"18\" />, choose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/f/00f64870b76e16d812d79938c0f7bd59426e8c2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{a_i,b_i\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/4/294992ae3886df17cbd8f3629901766154322178.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i&lt;b_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" /> so that no two pairs have a common element. Suppose that all the sums <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/4/de40c44271da884c1f5fc7553febec7c2c8043bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i+b_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> are distinct and less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/7/85727a3ea4f5d7ba25bc591590b0e085bca557b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2009$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />. Find the maximum possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that we have a valid solution with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> pairs. As all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/412787c048e28774dc63fc27db42dc52ca858de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94d9565abaadf04609a2e9941aa2d20b0a299b8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"12\" height=\"15\" /> are distinct, their sum is at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/f/00f40d6893da65d2084ca5bf49486a74052cb9e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2+3+\\cdots+2k=k(2k+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"253\" height=\"18\" />. On the other hand, as the sum of each pair is distinct and at most equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/7/85727a3ea4f5d7ba25bc591590b0e085bca557b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2009$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, the sum of all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/412787c048e28774dc63fc27db42dc52ca858de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94d9565abaadf04609a2e9941aa2d20b0a299b8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"12\" height=\"15\" /> is at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/2/61265ce65becb0fa64c28717ec225e4345438837.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2009 + (2009-1) + \\cdots + (2009-(k-1)) = \\frac{k(4019-k)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"453\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Hence we get a necessary condition on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />: For a solution to exist, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/c/3bc450c0d263e3493e906e7a9b203312dac3729a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{k(4019-k)}{2} \\geq k(2k+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"194\" height=\"38\" />. As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is positive, this simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2dda995e433755caed00b7845e0f80e3906d85b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4019-k}{2} \\geq 2k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"146\" height=\"37\" />, whence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/8/0284e0e0a16799332e73e093ea1e0c3e3f3bf2db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5k\\leq 4017$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" />, and as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is an integer, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/e/fbe5d7876e1c3c427ff254c56c4ff9849948f974.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\leq \\lfloor 4017/5\\rfloor = 803$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"155\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>If we now find a solution with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad2f1abf0c9da0694402fa334960dadbb8399033.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=803$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />, we can be sure that it is optimal. \n</p><p>From the proof it is clear that we don't have much \"maneuvering space\", if we want to construct a solution with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad2f1abf0c9da0694402fa334960dadbb8399033.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=803$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />.\nWe can try to use the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/e/b8ea7ee8a282949fd853a01537ec7a2b55e56f75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2k$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> smallest numbers: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2ae4240a77e08327cc84df3036fd0e2f12c643d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot 803 = 1606$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"109\" height=\"13\" />. \nWhen using these numbers, the average sum will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/f/94f96b3f23001b565eb02488adbc3dfa38313e1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1607$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />. Hence we can try looking for a nice systematic solution that achieves all sums between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/8/be8cb45863f3d11ba468624dc62feb2aa710bf71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1607-401=1206$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"145\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0e7cba351196cd7309d3187f548da56370855b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1607+401=2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"145\" height=\"14\" />, inclusive.\n</p><p>Such a solution indeed does exist, here is one:\n</p><p>Partition the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/c/2ac1c0c94f7da2fe8787095331f0a3f102ab703f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1606$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> into four sequences:\n</p>\n<ul><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/8/288d6774940febf371b76a04e42906dc8deb452c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=1,3,5,7,\\dots,801,803$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"200\" height=\"16\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/5/995d66e8ee3dfc46de55fd4471de42ecf8039d9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=1205,1204,1203,1202,\\dots,805,804$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"311\" height=\"16\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/8/ff80ad625639d6c66a7ee1bea93e403c7058d825.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C=2,4,6,8,\\dots,800,802$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"201\" height=\"16\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/a/0eaab9b766ee571ed659db6380e194c5b52ae947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D=1606,1605,1604,1603,\\dots,1207,1206$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"330\" height=\"16\" /></li></ul>\n<p>Sequences <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/d/6edb95e806210bac7f0d7bc811307ed37c04344a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$402$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> elements each, and the sums of their corresponding elements are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/d/0cda3665b35983c9f60fa10acd418440085d7938.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1206,1207,1208,1209,\\dots,1606,1607$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"290\" height=\"16\" />.\nSequences <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/c/81cee9ad6b2637a13289abebde92c8a470ec090f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$401$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> elements each, and the sums of their corresponding elements are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/f/fdf1bb7d4560c2cd61df935ed96acc34444b42a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1608,1609,1610,1611,\\dots,2007,2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"290\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Thus we have shown that there is a solution for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/c/f6cc76e67ce9731876d85d95bb912b6fa6d6685c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=\\boxed{803}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"73\" height=\"23\" /> and that for larger <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> no solution exists.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/yVP2MhOMSy4?si=ZC4Zo4xKe867uM8X\">https://youtu.be/yVP2MhOMSy4?si=ZC4Zo4xKe867uM8X</a>\n</p><p>~MathProblemSolvingSkills.com\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II\" title=\"2009 AIME II\">2009 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2009\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016235656\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 308/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1810/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 132/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8341/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.796      1 -total\n 59.39%    7.600      1 Template:AIME_box\n 38.84%    4.970      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8048:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016235656 and revision id 219326. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}